= Zinoviev Letter found. 

MI5 has informed the Home Office of a letter intercepted upon entry to the country, that claims to be from Chairman of the Communist International Grigory Zinoviev. Talking about how the Labour Governments closening of relations with russia is a ploy to foster a communist uprising. Bolderdash!!! What sick fools wrote this letter, probably to attempt to strike fear of all things left into the populace. Whatever it may be. Thankfully, the Secret Service informing us of their discovery allows us to prevent its exposure. 


- @step_forward

@step_forward
title: This plot is foiled.
